{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "126", "x": 0.8959551137550246, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03778813484861114, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "READING PASSAGE 2", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.158088903739382, "w": 0.29072257844517424, "h": 0.023179739115831682, "c": 1, "size": 16.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "You should spend about 20 minutes on Question 14 – 26, which are based on", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.19297526955329874, "w": 0.8271231662002294, "h": 0.02039118517446672, "c": 1, "size": 14.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Reading Passage 2.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.22353057824329664, "w": 0.21218456788243834, "h": 0.02039118517446672, "c": 1, "size": 14.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Adapting to the effects of climate change", "x": 0.21773162924557116, "y": 0.26382345694231296, "w": 0.6072498675633909, "h": 0.026142565890596797, "c": 1, "size": 18.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "A", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3401522797527106, "w": 0.022864551310304793, "h": 0.020391204035162976, "c": 1, "size": 14.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "All around the world, nations are already preparing for, and adapting to,", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.3414204729689256, "w": 0.7660291613776606, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "climate change and its impacts. Even if we stopped all CO2 emissions tomorrow,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.362334570947074, "w": 0.8260121032758466, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "we would continue to see the impact of the CO2 already released since industrial", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3826552359782417, "w": 0.8262076183627524, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "times, with scientists forecasting that global warming would continue for around", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4029760141735869, "w": 0.8266458100153141, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "40 years. In the meantime, ice caps would continue to melt and sea levels rise.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4234450751628923, "w": 0.8260117957009852, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Some countries and regions will suffer more extreme impacts from these changes", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.443765815636845, "w": 0.8261641477823392, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "than others. It's in these places that innovation is thriving.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4642348766261504, "w": 0.587709610986492, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "B", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.494518214076145, "w": 0.020206412464245704, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "In Miami Beach, Florida, USA, seawater isn't just breaching the island city's", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.494518214076145, "w": 0.7656651977916535, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "walls, it's seeping up through the ground, so the only way to save the city is to lift", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5148389545500978, "w": 0.8258158705142642, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "it up above sea level. Starting in the lowest and most vulnerable neighbourhoods,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5351596950240504, "w": 0.8260988393867654, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "roads have been raised by as much as 61 centimetres. The elevation work was", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5556287560133558, "w": 0.8263118862407719, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "carried out as part of Miami Beach's ambitious but much-needed stormwater-", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5759494964873085, "w": 0.8217342495783405, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "management programme. In addition to the road adaptations, the city has set up", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5962702369612611, "w": 0.826077001571605, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "new pumps that can remove up to 75,000 litres of water per minute. In the face of", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6167392979505666, "w": 0.8264913049099303, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "floods, climate-mitigation strategies have often been overlooked, says Yanira", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6370600007031267, "w": 0.8261575861852956, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Pineda, a senior sustainability coordinator. She knows that they're essential and", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6575291371352172, "w": 0.8259030167249982, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "that the job is far from over. 'We know that in 20, 30, 40 years, we'll need to go", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6778869200166155, "w": 0.826654832211249, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "back in there and adjust to the changing environment,' she says.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6982076604905683, "w": 0.6542788584420534, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "C", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7284662527070758, "w": 0.02101269433220525, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Seawalls are a staple strategy for many coastal communities, but on the", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.7284662527070758, "w": 0.765622342360963, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "soft, muddy northern shores of Java, Indonesia, they frequently collapse, further", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7489353136963811, "w": 0.8259900604107785, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "exacerbating coastal erosion. There have been many attempts to restore the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7692560541703338, "w": 0.8261614821335402, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "island's coastal mangroves: ecosystems of trees and shrubs that help defend", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7895767946442865, "w": 0.8258809738599302, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "coastal areas by trapping sediment in their net-like root systems, elevating the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8100458556335919, "w": 0.8264156414940224, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "sea bed and dampening the energy of waves and tidal currents. But Susanna Toi", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8303665961075446, "w": 0.8265872682666916, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "of the not-for-profit organisation Wetlands International says that, while hugely", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8508356570968499, "w": 0.8261688639302142, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "popular, the majority of mangrove-planting projects fail. So, Wetlands", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8711811428042898, "w": 0.8265196017971804, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "International started out with a different approach, building semi-permeable", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8915018832782425, "w": 0.8267424910467521, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "dams, made from bamboo poles and brushwood, to mimic the role of mangrove", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.9119709442675479, "w": 0.8260553688063522, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "roots and create favourable conditions for mangroves to grow back naturally. The", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.9322916847415006, "w": 0.8262511914681194, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}